25	/**
26	 * Source-of-truth readiness check that calls Stripe directly. Returns one of:
27	 *   - { ready: true }            — Stripe says the account is fully ready
28	 *   - { ready: false }           — Stripe says the account is NOT ready
29	 *   - { ready: false, error: … } — Stripe call failed; caller must NOT promote
30	 *
31	 * Used at the verification gate. Fail-closed by design: when we can't reach
32	 * Stripe, we refuse to advance the facility rather than trusting a possibly
33	 * stale cache. The caller surfaces a 503 so the owner retries later.
